  - ui-ux-pro-max's recommended accent (#DC2626) would have collided with 2026-08-28's rationed
    arterial red (#E64B38). Overridden with a custom palette.
  - Demo: removed a dead setInterval that rewrote the clock to the same value, and a CSS
